# .dockerignore
# What Docker leaves out when it builds server/Dockerfile from this folder. Mainly this keeps secrets and backups out of
# the image, including the top-level .env, which holds the build server's API key.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
server/backups/
server/test/
server/docker-compose*.yml
**/*.sh
**/node_modules/
.git/
.expo/
dist/
dist-android/
android/
ios/
security-reports/
.security-private-patterns
docs/
test/
